# The image is built from the repository root (docker build -f server/Dockerfile .).
# Nothing is sent to the daemon unless it is listed here: the Python package, the
# console's sources and the contract it is generated from.
*

!server/pyproject.toml
!server/uv.lock
!server/README.md
!server/src/

!web/package.json
!web/package-lock.json
!web/index.html
!web/tsconfig.json
!web/vite.config.ts
!web/src/
!web/public/
!web/scripts/

!shared/i18n/
!shared/design/

# Never: local state, build output, caches, secrets.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/__pycache__
**/.venv
**/*.sqlite*
**/*.db
**/secret.key
**/setup-code
